    {"severity": "warning", "type": "copybook_level_01_under_01", "file_id": "SYS-PORTFOLIO-001-FIL-0052", "source_id": "RTNCDE00", "line": 26, "message": "EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA (line 26) under 01 WS-DB2-AREA and COPY RTNCODE (line 30) under 01 RC-REQUEST-AREA bring in level-01 records (SQL-STATUS-CODES, RETURN-CODE-AREA). A level-01 inside a copybook starts a new record, so WS-DB2-AREA and RC-REQUEST-AREA have no subordinate items of their own (inline_bytes 0). The expansions are registered as EXPANDS_COPY from the holding 01 records, whose total_bytes therefore include the copybook record sizes (35 and 165)."}
